     "<div>secr 4.5.3 is now fully on CRAN. See the <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/secr/NEWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/secr/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486767538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2piZvaxQm3WTEKQNgkljsy\">NEWS</a> file for a definitive list of changes, or <a href=\"https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/News.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/News.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486767538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_NJHqTAirHXzYOPxG5dOp\">here</a>\n for a summary. The latest version has moved to simple features (package\n &#39;sf&#39;) for interfacing spatial data, but previous formats should still \nbe accepted (see <a href=\"https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-spatialdata.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-spatialdata.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486767538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00gHGVEhrjcpq4rX6GXHWX\">secr-spatialdata.pdf</a> for more). The shiny app hosted at Otago University has also been updated (<a href=\"https://www.stats.otago.ac.nz/secrapp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.stats.otago.ac.nz/secrapp/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486767538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-jIUjGXW0Wqr0db5OuJzm\">secrapp 1.4</a> allows one-click loading of built-in datasets).</div><div><br></div><div>secrdesign 2.6.0 last month was the first update for a while, with only minor <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/secrdesign/NEWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/secrdesign/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486767538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1I2XnHwKMfcE6rhLCpAuI-\">changes</a>. See also the updated shiny app <a href=\"https://www.stats.otago.ac.nz/secrdesignapp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.stats.otago.ac.nz/secrdesignapp/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486767538000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zjPcslvRGn3uEtz9OyJnD\">secrdesign 1.5</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>Please report any problems (ideally as GitHub issues for the shiny apps).<br></div>"
